OL,3,GNEWSACricket club's 'curveball' wins
OL,4,Atea deal donation
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "curveball idea" by a cricket club
OL,7,Fhas led to a donation from a baronet in
OL,8,Fexchange for two cups of tea per year.
OL,10,FSedgwick Cricket Club has been
OL,11,Ffundraising to buy an acre of land to
OL,12,Festablish a full cricket oval on its
OL,13,Fcurrent ground off Back Lane in
OL,14,FSedgwick, south of Kendal.
OL,16,FCaptain Adam Kershaw said they were
OL,17,Finspired to write to Sir Humphry
OL,18,FWakefield as they already had on
OL,19,Fdisplay an old letter from him talking
OL,20,Fabout a "great game" played in Sedgwick
OL,21,Fby legendary cricketer WG Grace.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
